			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Brain Screenshot sends your latest screenshot to your Brain Cockpit.

What it does:
- Asks three setup questions when you import it: your Brain Cockpit address, your access token, and whether to describe screenshots with Apple Intelligence
- Stops with a message if the address ends with a slash or if no screenshot exists
- Shrinks the newest screenshot, converts it to a JPEG, and builds a random capture key
- Optionally writes a short description with Use Model and attaches it to the upload
- Uploads the image, then shows a notification saying whether it worked</string>
			</dict>
